OL,3,GNEWSATen arrests as balaclava-wearing
OL,4,Ateens clash with weapons
OL,5,
OL,6,FTen arrests have been made after police
OL,7,Fwere called to large-scale violent
OL,8,Fdisorder involving teenagers with
OL,9,Fweapons including machetes, knives and
OL,10,Fbats.
OL,12,FGreater Manchester Police officers were
OL,13,Fcalled to the incident on South Street
OL,14,Fin Lower Openshaw, Manchester, at about
OL,15,F12:50 BST.
OL,17,FThe force said they found a large group
OL,18,Fof youths at the scene, with many
OL,19,Fwearing balaclavas, and various weapons
OL,20,Fincluding machetes, knives and bats
OL,21,Fwere reportedly used.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
